{
    "title": "Blinck Dating App: Meet & Date",
    "description": "Blinck is a free dating app helping singles find fun, meaningful, and exciting connections. It's the dating app where everyone is welcome, and making new connections has never been easier.\r\n\r\nBlinck is dedicated to helping singles find fun, meaningful, and exciting connections. It's the dating app where everyone is welcome, and creating new relationships is simple and enjoyable. We champion respect and equality, celebrating every orientation and background. So whether you're straight, gay, lesbian, trans, here to find love, here to find fun, here to find friends, or just exploring\u2014connecting with new people has never been more accessible.\r\n\r\nOur community is filled with thousands of people across the globe who are ready to chat, meet new people, build genuine and meaningful connections, and maybe find that special someone they've been looking for.\r\n\r\nDATE, MEET NEW FRIENDS, AND CONNECT\r\n\r\nOur innovative technology is constantly evolving to create a fun, engaging, and most importantly, safe experience for you:\r\n\r\nBlinck Dating: Where connections happen naturally. We've designed Blinck so that everyone can form meaningful relationships safely and respectfully.\r\n\r\nBlinck Friends: Life is better with friends. Whether you're new to a city or hoping to expand your circle, Blinck Friends is an easy way to make new friends.\r\n\r\nBlinck Synastry: Discover deeper connections through astrology. Our Synastry feature compares birth charts to help you find compatible matches based on astrological compatibility. Find out if your stars align!\r\n\r\nPRIVACY AND SECURITY FIRST\r\n\r\nWe believe in a better world where everyone feels safe and respected. Your personal data is securely stored on Blinck. Our community guidelines ensure a respectful environment where everyone can feel safe to be themselves.\r\n\r\nDON'T JUST TAKE OUR WORD FOR IT\r\n\r\n\"Blinck is revolutionizing the way people connect, making it easier than ever to find meaningful relationships.\"\r\n\r\n\"Blinck offers an alternative that prioritizes meaningful connections, with everyone calling the shots.\"\r\n\r\nLike the best things in life, Blinck is free to download and use. But we do also offer optional subscription packages (Blinck Premium) and single or multiple-use paid services for which no subscription is required (including Blinckers and SuperLikes).\r\n\r\nWe offer weekly, monthly, 3-month, and 6-month subscriptions with varying discounts. Prices may vary per country and are subject to change without notice. Prices are clearly displayed in the app.\r\n\r\nPayment: Payment will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase.\r\n\r\nAuto-Renewal: Your subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\nRenewal Charges: Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions: You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal by going to your Account Settings in the iTunes Store.\r\n\r\nFree Usage: If you don\u2019t choose to purchase Blinck Premium, you can simply continue using and enjoying Blinck for free.\r\n\r\nPRIVACY POLICY AND TERMS\r\n\r\nYour personal data is securely stored on Blinck\u2014be sure to read our privacy policy and terms and conditions:\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://blinckapp.com/privacypolicy/\r\nTerms of Use: https://blinckapp.com/termsofuse/\r\n\r\nBLINCK INC.\r\n\r\nBlinck Inc. is the parent company of Blinck, committed to creating a better and more connected world.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Blinck is a free dating app helping singles find fun, meaningful, and exciting connections. It&#39;s the dating app where everyone is welcome, and making new connections has never been easier.<br><br>Blinck is dedicated to helping singles find fun, meaningful, and exciting connections. It&#39;s the dating app where everyone is welcome, and creating new relationships is simple and enjoyable. We champion respect and equality, celebrating every orientation and background. So whether you&#39;re straight, gay, lesbian, trans, here to find love, here to find fun, here to find friends, or just exploring\u2014connecting with new people has never been more accessible.<br><br>Our community is filled with thousands of people across the globe who are ready to chat, meet new people, build genuine and meaningful connections, and maybe find that special someone they&#39;ve been looking for.<br><br>DATE, MEET NEW FRIENDS, AND CONNECT<br><br>Our innovative technology is constantly evolving to create a fun, engaging, and most importantly, safe experience for you:<br><br>Blinck Dating: Where connections happen naturally. We&#39;ve designed Blinck so that everyone can form meaningful relationships safely and respectfully.<br><br>Blinck Friends: Life is better with friends. Whether you&#39;re new to a city or hoping to expand your circle, Blinck Friends is an easy way to make new friends.<br><br>Blinck Synastry: Discover deeper connections through astrology. Our Synastry feature compares birth charts to help you find compatible matches based on astrological compatibility. Find out if your stars align!<br><br>PRIVACY AND SECURITY FIRST<br><br>We believe in a better world where everyone feels safe and respected. Your personal data is securely stored on Blinck. Our community guidelines ensure a respectful environment where everyone can feel safe to be themselves.<br><br>DON&#39;T JUST TAKE OUR WORD FOR IT<br><br>&quot;Blinck is revolutionizing the way people connect, making it easier than ever to find meaningful relationships.&quot;<br><br>&quot;Blinck offers an alternative that prioritizes meaningful connections, with everyone calling the shots.&quot;<br><br>Like the best things in life, Blinck is free to download and use. But we do also offer optional subscription packages (Blinck Premium) and single or multiple-use paid services for which no subscription is required (including Blinckers and SuperLikes).<br><br>We offer weekly, monthly, 3-month, and 6-month subscriptions with varying discounts. Prices may vary per country and are subject to change without notice. Prices are clearly displayed in the app.<br><br>Payment: Payment will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase.<br><br>Auto-Renewal: Your subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br><br>Renewal Charges: Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br><br>Manage Subscriptions: You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal by going to your Account Settings in the iTunes Store.<br><br>Free Usage: If you don\u2019t choose to purchase Blinck Premium, you can simply continue using and enjoying Blinck for free.<br><br>PRIVACY POLICY AND TERMS<br><br>Your personal data is securely stored on Blinck\u2014be sure to read our privacy policy and terms and conditions:<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://blinckapp.com/privacypolicy/<br>Terms of Use: https://blinckapp.com/termsofuse/<br><br>BLINCK INC.<br><br>Blinck Inc. is the parent company of Blinck, committed to creating a better and more connected world.",
